{"version":1,"content":"<p>女團Lolly Talk（LT）成員鄭芷淇（Elka）以個人身分「elka」，加盟獨立唱片公司並正式出道，今年展開跨年Solo音樂企劃，集結「香港三大詞人」的作品；</p><p>下月舉辦首個個人音樂會《el_ka》，門票在開售後不足5小時售罄，難怪她被封為今年樂壇「怪物新人」。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:04.852988+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T09:29:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T06:17:39.416176+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684322+00:00","content_hash":"ac3183827e14f859a0f93c504bf2872371279e180639d059ff8f6f29d7350e89","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}